      "mergeID": "5e8f575a9f6e595d6418590d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "sometimes when i change worlds or someone changes to an other avatar my Creation list and Favorite list just disappear for no reason and not coming back until i restart the game",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Creation and favorite list dissapearing for no reason",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5da8cf3492e64d507d4d397b",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Somewhat related to https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/opening-socialavatarworlds-with-an-expired-authcookie-ie-due-to-changed-ip-addre\nWhat you're experiencing is an expired authcookie, either due to VRChat invalidating the authcookie session or when your IP address changes. Restarting VRChat and then logging in again will temporarily fix this issue, at least until the authcookie expires again.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-10-17T20:29:40.223Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As title says, when the authcookie expires, for example due to an IP address change (forced reconnect on DSL), the client repeatedly tries to refresh avatar favorites, world favorites, friends, friend favorites, etc. without a retry sleep timer (exponential backoff anyone?). This essentially floods the API with lots of HTTP requests all getting rejected with \"Missing Credentials\" which makes the client lag a lot while the social tab is open and write a lot of different variations of that same error message into the log (see also the attached screenshot):\n\nFailed to fetch Licensed avatars - \"Missing Credentials\"\nError fetching favorite avatars: \"Missing Credentials\"\nFailed to fetch Favorite avatars - \"Missing Credentials\"\nError fetching favorite worlds: \"Missing Credentials\"\n[Always] Could not fetch avatars with error - \"Missing Credentials\"\nCould not fetch users groups - \"Missing Credentials\"\nCould not fetch moderations with error - \"Missing Credentials\"\nFailed to fetch OnlineFriends friends - \"Missing Credentials\"\nError fetching Favorite Friends: \"Missing Credentials\"",
  "error": null,
